                    to the Paraguayan Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d78-f2" n="63" xml:id="d78-f2-content">
                <p>In the Neutrals’ note to Paraguay, substitute: [Here follows text of telegram of
